WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:05.339
- I don't like anyone listening
to the songs I write.

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:07.966
- Ever?

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.344
- They're for me.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.139
- In one word, who are you?

00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:16.099
- Only one word?
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:16.934
- Hmm.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:21.230
- Mess.
Bess the mess.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.731
Not the whole picture.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.777
♪ I don't know what it is ♪

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.445
- My dad raised us
after my mom left.

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:30.531
♪ What it is about me ♪

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:31.949
But I have no safety net.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.409
♪ I don't know how
to get where I'm going ♪

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:36.954
♪ I keep showing up
wherever I've already been ♪

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.623
I've got rent,
my brother's Medicaid co-pay.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.711
- Bess, there are
82 words in your new song.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:46.380
The average song is 165 words.

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.507
- Exactly. That's why
I need to go home and finish it.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:53.303
- Why do you write songs
for no one to listen to?

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:55.973
- I tried. It didn't go over.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.182
I'm sorry.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:58.308
- I think that takes guts.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.436
♪ Opening my eyes ♪

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.605
♪ To daylight... ♪

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.441
- When you sing,
your soul is all over your face.

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:08.485
♪ Maybe I will wander ♪

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:10.028
- We should play together some time.

00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:14.616
♪ Too far away
from where I started ♪

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.952
♪ There is another ♪

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:20.372
- I watched you push away one dude
who seems to really like you...

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:23.292
and not this other dude
who's living with his girlfriend.

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.209
♪ Do you know? ♪

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:25.961
- Bess, this is Lina.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:26.920
- I can't do this right now.

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:28.589
♪ What you fight for? ♪

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:30.048
♪ I want more ♪

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:32.926
- Who am I to--

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:33.927
- Do what your father couldn't do?

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:37.764
You playing small isn't
going to make him bigger.

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:39.683
♪ There is another ♪

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.101
- My dad always said...

00:01:43.187 --> 00:01:45.230
sometimes you just gotta do it
for the love of it.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.900
♪ Do you know ♪

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.318
♪ What you fight for? ♪

00:01:49.902 --> 00:01:51.695
♪ What you fight for? ♪

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.238
♪ I want more ♪

